{"version":1,"key":"card:591","content":{"id":591,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"61c9e8d5-4cc6-4a7c-a5ce-425f41c732c0","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Content-Length"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 用来指定 HTTP 请求体或响应体所占字节的大小，除非是分块传输（"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Transfer-Encoding: chunked"},{"type":"formatted","text":"），否则必须携带 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Content-Length"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来指明实体主体的大小（如果没有携带主体，可以省略），否则就会存在以下问题："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"893b9dd6-5421-4745-ac46-b8acb336b32d","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"faaff11a-d9f7-4b0f-bb41-05bf607c42a1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"75cc1ea8-dabb-4a32-b566-1b4c72cb88bb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"报文截断：如果没有设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Content-Length"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当连接关闭时，客户端无法识别是传输完成连接正常关闭还是服务器错误导致报文截断的传输错误，即客户端不知道报文是否是完整的，客户端需要通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Content-Length"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来验证报文是否完整"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"eaff343e-55a6-4f9b-b0e2-63ccc0902251","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这对缓存服务器的影响更严重，因为它可能会缓存不完整的内容，缓存服务器不应该缓存未设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Content-Length"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 头的 HTTP 主体以减少风险"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"81444394-e238-45b2-ac34-8c58e89197cf","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7957997e-40e0-44ba-983a-8b15855f8d3b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"持久连接：在使用持久连接（"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Connection: Keep-Alive"},{"type":"formatted","text":"），多个 HTTP 请求可以复用同一个 TCP 连接，如果没有设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Content-Length"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，则无法知道这个请求/响应是什么时候结束的，不知道下一条报文从哪里开始"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"907be07f-a36f-45f3-8843-2c166518772a","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8742b784-db12-4978-8094-0a5ced5bcf75","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"性能：客户端无法提前分配好正确大小的缓存，可能会频繁的调整缓冲区大小，造成性能损耗"}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"注意","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"6e9fd079-fb67-44d2-aa59-fa0f0decc2f1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"46a57ab0-4157-4cd3-8e3d-5f71a26b4cde","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Content-Length"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指定的是实际传输的主体大小，因为为了安全或成本考虑，会对主体进行编码或压缩， "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Content-Length"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指的是编码压缩后的主体的大小，而不是原始主体的大小。"}]}]}],"tags":["HTTP/Content-Length"],"createTime":1752460019518,"updateTime":1752461235628,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752461235628}}